{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sdiveoxy-self-contained-underwater-breathing-apparatus-scuba-cylinder-set-0-dot-5l-sold-via-ebay-2511-0239","content_id":"e656394c-7788-47cc-b32c-f8037dda41de","description":"Product Recall for SDIVEOXY Self-Contained Underwater Breathing Apparatus (SCUBA) Cylinder Set 0.5L presenting a serious risk of drowning. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d18d3ae5-ebf6-4ceb-aba0-46591f84c4b2","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-27T15:58:50+00:00","id":"d18d3ae5-ebf6-4ceb-aba0-46591f84c4b2","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-27T15:58:50+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6928753ab3b9afff34e9617b/2511-0239-product-recall-SDIVEOXY-Diving-Oxygen-Cylinder__1_.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: SDIVEOXY Self-Contained Underwater Breathing Apparatus (SCUBA) Cylinder Set 0.5L sold via eBay.</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of drowning as it failed depth testing and does not meet the requirements of BS EN 250:2014.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: OPSS are requiring the recall of the product from end users.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (eBay).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Personal protective equipment (PPE) - Environmental Respiratory Protection - Non Powered</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>SDIVEOXY</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>eBay Item Number</td>\n      <td>304981356923</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Hong Kong</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Lime green Self-Contained Underwater Breathing Apparatus (SCUBA) set with cylinder of 0.5L volume.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d18d3ae5-ebf6-4ceb-aba0-46591f84c4b2\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6928753ab3b9afff34e9617b/2511-0239-product-recall-SDIVEOXY-Diving-Oxygen-Cylinder__1_.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of drowning as it failed depth testing and does not meet the requirements of BS EN 250:2014. The maximum depth reached by the apparatus without exceeding the requirements was 5 metres, not the 50m required. If the product is used in depths beyond 5 metres, it may stop operating. Improvements are also required to labelling and marking.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Regulation (EU) 2016/425 on Personal Protective Equipment.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>OPSS are requiring the recall of the product from end users. Consumers who own the product are advised to stop using it immediately and contact the distributor for redress.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (eBay).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0239</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-27T16:00:04Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"personal-protective-equipment-ppe","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-27","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-27T16:00:04+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sdiveoxy-self-contained-underwater-breathing-apparatus-scuba-cylinder-set-0-dot-5l-sold-via-ebay-2511-0239","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sdiveoxy-self-contained-underwater-breathing-apparatus-scuba-cylinder-set-0-dot-5l-sold-via-ebay-2511-0239","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sdiveoxy-self-contained-underwater-breathing-apparatus-scuba-cylinder-set-0-dot-5l-sold-via-ebay-2511-0239","content_id":"e656394c-7788-47cc-b32c-f8037dda41de","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-27T16:00:04Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: SDIVEOXY Self-Contained Underwater Breathing Apparatus (SCUBA) Cylinder Set 0.5L  sold via eBay (2511-0239) ","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sdiveoxy-self-contained-underwater-breathing-apparatus-scuba-cylinder-set-0-dot-5l-sold-via-ebay-2511-0239","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of t